    "definition": "Derived local static metadata and required-file presence only. runtime_ready means derived_local_static: the declared relative files exist in a source checkout and any declared static text markers match. It does not mean imports, process start, service health, online status, real use or any research outcome. No process, service, network, model or research run is started, contacted or observed."
